    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "l appeals were marginally more likely to be dismissed (27% of s95 cases were dismissed compared with 24% of s4 cases). We believe this difference was due to the fact that the majority of s95 appeals related to complex destitution appeals. TOP 5 ISSUES IN Q1: 2"
